<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch ups Hang Seng Bnk warrants.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch ups Hang Seng Bnk warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has issued a further 41 million American-style call warrants on Hang Seng Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    HK$90	    PREMIUM	    11.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$1.20	  GEARING	    7.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	01.OCT.97	SETTLEMENT DATE  10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     11.MAR.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE PRICE HK$91.75	 MIN EXER LOT     1,000</p>
<p> NOTES	     PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
